  "description": "Welcome to 15 Cuirt Eanna, a stylish one-bedroom, own-door apartment set within a beautifully maintained O` Malley-built development on The Long Walk. This charming apartment enjoys a prime location in a peaceful courtyard setting.\n\nThe apartment, spanning approximately 520 sq. ft., has been tastefully upgraded by the current owners and is in excellent decorative order throughout. Upon entry, a small lobby with a feature glass block wall leads into the spacious open-plan living/dining room and kitchen. The living and dining area boasts a wooden floor and shutter blinds, while the kitchen at the rear is beautifully appointed with ceiling-high built-in units and a range of Bosch integrated appliances.\n\nThe generously sized bedroom features a wooden floor, extensive built-in wardrobes, and shutter blinds. Adjoining the bedroom is a spacious en-suite complete with a large walk-in shower and rainfall showerhead.\n\nCuirt Eanna enjoys an enviable city-centre location, with access from The Long Walk and The Docks. Within minutes walk, you will find a range of amenities including restaurants, bars, coffee shops, cinema, shops, hotels, and public transport. Galway`s vibrant city streets, including Quay Street, Shop Street, and the Westend, are just a short stroll away.",
